1. Remove dead code from frontend components
    [x] 'content/web-ui/frontend/input-box.js': Remove `clearFocus()` method
        - No caller exists anywhere in the codebase
    [x] 'content/web-ui/frontend/message.js': Remove `#complete` field and `#prefillEnd` field
        - `#complete` is set to `true` in `setPerformanceTimings` but never read
        - `#prefillEnd` is assigned in `#maybeAdvancePhase` but `#buildStatsLine` never references it
    [x] 'content/web-ui/frontend/message.js': Remove `collapsed` property, its setter guard in `onConnect`, and the `prefill` parameter + `if (prefill)` branch in `clanker-app.js` `#generateResponse`
